# EDGE AI OS dev-tier sudo override.
#
# Shipped ONLY in edge-image-dev (via the edge-sudoers-nopasswd sub-package).
# edge-image-base does NOT install this file — production posture keeps
# the password gate from 10-edge-wheel.
#
# Sudo evaluates files in /etc/sudoers.d/ in lexical order, last match
# per spec wins. 15- comes after 10-edge-wheel, so the NOPASSWD spec
# below overrides the password-required line in 10-edge-wheel for the
# %wheel group.
#
# Reasoning: dev images are for bring-up / profiling / stress testing.
# Every interactive command path is repeated dozens of times per
# session; the password prompt is friction without security value on a
# bench box. Production (edge-image-base) keeps the password gate
# because that is the CRA-aligned posture for shipped devices.

%wheel ALL=(ALL:ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL
